  "releaseNotes": "An adversarial audit of LC045's reporting surface: 15 shapes that must stay quiet and 14 that must report were all confirmed correct. One false-negative family is recorded and pinned — a navigation read on a loop variable inside an expression-level conditional (ternary, switch expression, ?. or ??) is not reported, while the equivalent if/else and the single-entity form are. No analyzer behaviour changes.",
